[36m(TaskRunner pid=2971282)[0m To find the value of \( x \), we start by using the definition of the arithmetic mean. The arithmetic mean of a set of numbers is the sum of the numbers divided by the count of the numbers. Here, the set of numbers is \( 7, 2, x, \) and \( 10 \), and the arithmetic mean is \( 9 \). The arithmetic mean is calculated as follows:
