[36m(TaskRunner pid=2971282)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2971282)[0m Next, we eliminate the fraction by multiplying both sides of the equation by 4:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2971282)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2971282)[0m \[
