[36m(TaskRunner pid=2971282)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2971282)[0m Similarly, we calculate the number of ways to form a subcommittee that contains no Democrats. This means the subcommittee must consist only of Republicans. Since there are 8 Republicans, the number of ways to choose a subcommittee of 5 members from these 8 Republicans is:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2971282)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2971282)[0m \[
