[36m(TaskRunner pid=2971282)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2971282)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2971282)[0m The number of ways to form a subcommittee of 5 members that includes at least one member from each party is the total number of ways to form a subcommittee of 5 members minus the number of ways to form a subcommittee that is not compliant. Therefore, we subtract the two results calculated above:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2971282)[0m 
