[36m(TaskRunner pid=2971282)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2971282)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2971282)[0m Next, eliminate the denominator by multiplying both sides of the equation by 4:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2971282)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2971282)[0m \[
