[36m(TaskRunner pid=2971282)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2971282)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2971282)[0m Then, isolate \( x \) by subtracting 19 from both sides of the equation:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2971282)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2971282)[0m \[
