[36m(TaskRunner pid=2971282)[0m which is not possible. Instead, we rewrite it as:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2971282)[0m \[ 8n \equiv -53 \pmod{8} \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2971282)[0m \[ 8n \equiv -53 + 24 \pmod{8} \]
