[36m(TaskRunner pid=2971282)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2971282)[0m Next, we calculate the number of ways to form a subcommittee that has all members from one party, i.e., either all Republicans or all Democrats. We will consider each case separately and then subtract these from the total number of combinations to get the number of valid subcommittees.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2971282)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2971282)[0m 1. The number of ways to form a subcommittee with all Republicans:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2971282)[0m \[
