[36m(TaskRunner pid=2971282)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2971282)[0m 2. **Set up the equation**: Using the definition of the arithmetic mean, we can set up the equation as:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2971282)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2971282)[0m    \[
